Z||000008||JBGehling||03-11-2001||01:52 PM||||hehe, this isn't the first time I've argued this and DEFINITELY won't be the last!<BR>The New trans-ams are the best looking firebirds EVER!!!what year looks better? 60's-70's? Looks like everything else on the road. 80's- can you say BORING, it's an average looking sports car in nearly every-way. early-mid 90's-- The front looks totally wrong, especially w/ram-air. The new Trans-am's are just simply gorgeous. Everything seems to fit just right. Of course, this is all just my opinion.    <BR>          As for the new camaros, I won't argue that they're pretty, those headlights are disgusting and it looks more like a sporty cruiser rather than a real sports car.<BR>         I'll even venture to say that, IMO, a red WS6 Trans-am w/leather interior, t-tops and 6-speed, is my second favorite GM car (first is the new corvettes). <P>oh well, no-one's opinions are the same, I just thought beauty was undeniable ( <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">, jk).<P>Josh<BR>||||reg||1
